<title>HONG KONG: TENNIS-HONG KONG OPEN FIRST-ROUND RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-HONG KONG OPEN FIRST-ROUND RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>First-round results in the $328,000 Hong Kong Open tennis tournament on Monday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>8-Daniel Vacek (Czech Republic) beat Alexander Volkov (Russia) 6-4 7-6 (7-3)</p>
<p>2-Marc Rosset (Switzerland) beat Nicolas Kiefer (Germany) 6-2 6-2</p>
<p>Justin Gimelstob (U.S.) beat Henrik Holm (Sweden) 1-6 7-6 (7-1) 6-2</p>
</text>
